{"path":"utility/variant/hash","title":"std::hash<std::variant>","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>hash<small>&lt;std::variant&gt;</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/hash","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"The template specialization of std::hash for the std::variant template allows users to obtain hashes of variant objects.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/variant\">&lt;variant&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> hash<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The template specialization of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\">std::hash</a></span> for the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\">std::variant</a></span> template allows users to obtain hashes of <code>variant</code> objects.\n</p><p>The specialization <code class=\"t-c\"><code>std::hash</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span></span></code> is enabled (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\">std::hash</a></span>) if every specialization in <code class=\"t-c\"><code>std::hash</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/remove_cv\"><span class=\"kw603\">std::<span class=\"me2\">remove_const_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span>...</span></code> is enabled, and is disabled otherwise.\n</p><p>The member functions of this specialization are not guaranteed to be noexcept.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> Types\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the types of the alternatives supported by the <code>variant</code> object\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Unlike <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/hash\"><code>std::hash&lt;std::optional&gt;</code></a>, hash of a variant does not typically equal the hash of the contained value; this makes it possible to distinguish <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> holding the same value as different alternatives.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;variant&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Var <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Var <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> var<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"get&lt;\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> var.<span class=\"me1\">index</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"&gt; = \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"# = \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"><span class=\"kw1132\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hash</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Var<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Var var<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2020</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    var.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2023</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    var.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2026</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    var <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"C++\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>var<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>get&lt;0&gt; = 2020   # = 2020\nget&lt;1&gt; = 2023   # = 2024\nget&lt;2&gt; = 2026   # = 2028\nget&lt;3&gt; = C++    # = 15518724754199266859</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hash</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  hash function object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variant","title":"std::variant"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::hash<std::variant>","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. The template specialization of std::hash for the std::variant template allows users to obtain hashes of variant objects."},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"Types"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Unlike std::hash<std::optional>, hash of a variant does not typically equal the hash of the contained value; this makes it possible to distinguish…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"hash","note":"hash function object"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":198,"codeBlockCount":2}
